<div class="story-break"><div><strong>It's the kind of result that makes you question what you're actually measuring.</strong><p>A list of centers makes sense on a spreadsheet. Does it make sense when you picture Charles Barkley playing basketball?</p></div><span>4 / 5</span></div>

